  lines:
  - id: take_bench
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: session.enter.first
    text: Bench is yours. Lay it out.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c64539313dfcb5d1f58849b77818d027, type: 3}
  - id: stage1
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: stage.start:1
    text: Cell's out. Now strip it, grip first.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a5f73c7c9dff88b54587b30ec209c371, type: 3}
  - id: stage2
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: stage.start:2
    text: Frame in the cradle. Servo next. Go gentle, that's the good part.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 79a63ac0aef14df3746d891ae82593d9, type: 3}
  - id: stage3
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: stage.start:3
    text: Clean that gimbal, wire it, then cut your plates.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57188181289359941c0991843b78b519, type: 3}
  - id: stage4
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: stage.start:4
    text: Core next. The press won't forgive a dirty mould.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b173f8433cb2b504bdefdc9dfe20f74c, type: 3}
  - id: stage5
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: stage.start:5
    text: Core's sound. Now put the grip together.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0ddeac934b2a6f0564687ad116e07f6e, type: 3}
  - id: stage6
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: stage.start:6
    text: Grip's done. Put it on the pistol.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 78367ba8400f40343a8ab62838dfb7f8, type: 3}
  - id: stage7
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: stage.start:7
    text: That's it. Shake it, then shoot a fresh card.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a612df1e5924a2af7b914790f1e8f97c, type: 3}
  - id: stuck_screw
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.fault_first:s1.screw_b
    text: Lower one's seized. Oil it, tap it, then turn. Don't force it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74145ce93aff56531a32c4b3c5f48b72, type: 3}
  - id: cracked_tang
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s1.inspect
    text: See that crack in the tang? That's why it walks off target.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 724f3bed0fa6ebdcf0c3ad55346e8827, type: 3}
  - id: fault_camout
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: fault.first:camout
    text: Wrong bit. You'll chew the head.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 58ddd2d49701ca6aabd7b100970b11bc, type: 3}
  - id: fault_stripped
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: fault.first:stripped
    text: Head's gone. Pliers. Slow.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e6e7b57d738d2b739fde9975d3196803, type: 3}
  - id: fault_short_lead
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: fault.first:short_lead
    text: Cut it short. You'll be splicing that.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e717def83b000c348bb5fb76110fa79d, type: 3}
  - id: fault_cold_joint
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: fault.first:cold_joint
    text: Cold joint. Dull and grey. Heat it again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 11d22951767a23fed94a1da415b8f6bb, type: 3}
  - id: fault_overbend
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: fault.first:over_bend
    text: Too far. Bend it back once. Only once.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c73fe1cf93e989bddb849801f537923a, type: 3}
  - id: fault_flew_off
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: fault.first:flew_off
    text: Little ones fly. Find it before you go on.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30f6076d4900b68811a5b02e69397798, type: 3}
  - id: hint_schematic
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: hint.idle25:a
    text: Check the schematic. It shows where you are.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b31c4957c5df02a35885af8a83e3b7de, type: 3}
  - id: hint_mat
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: hint.idle25:b
    text: Empty outline on the mat. Something's still on.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb939f2c71f9f24c189e211b90ef2ce7, type: 3}
  - id: hint_tool
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: hint.idle25:c
    text: Right tool makes it easy. Wrong one makes a mess.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5267175da2d65654c9c068ea439c4fe, type: 3}
  - id: spin_good
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s3.spin
    text: Hear that? Clean. That'll do.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fbc281520afbbead662b187d4275cb79, type: 3}
  - id: spin_bad
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.fault:s3.spin
    text: Grinding. There's still grit in it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dba7084345fe546d9b88c576a9ee7558, type: 3}
  - id: press
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.start:s4.press
    text: Keep it in the green.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86216bcca758e78138370a4f53a17631, type: 3}
  - id: damper_good
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s5.damp
    text: One tick and still. That's the damper working.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b55358347f87b71c12c10d0e37828f3, type: 3}
  - id: damper_bad
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.fault:s5.damp
    text: Still swinging. Something's pinched in there.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b97ef149fd442f1d18814e630b129d1c, type: 3}
  - id: card_before
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s0.card_before
    text: All over the card. That's what you're fixing.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39a30a6ac3a1be0843aaa877e20f55a6, type: 3}
  - id: card_after_rough
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s7.card_after:Rough
    text: Better. Rough, but it holds.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7f2ae941e6493541a7073133cd8004bd, type: 3}
  - id: card_after_standard
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s7.card_after:Standard
    text: Tight group. Honest work.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ed66f5619e0374bb77879a31177adfd, type: 3}
  - id: card_after_fine
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s7.card_after:Fine
    text: Look at that. I couldn't have done it better.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc8081b496f463b9f3cce40b29f654ca, type: 3}
  - id: hand_over
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: step.done:s7.leave
    text: Range. Go and feel the difference.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f670887101a8c461ccc38b307d04c50, type: 3}
  - id: step_away
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: session.leave.unfinished
    text: Leave it there. It'll keep.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff6e236c9d4634ddc157f4e478e430ec, type: 3}
  - id: come_back
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: session.enter.resume
    text: Pick up where you left off.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21d5dc59db3c66d596858c8d7ef1501d, type: 3}
  - id: abandon
    speaker: npc_brann
    trigger: session.abandon
    text: Packing it in? Your parts go back. What's cut stays cut.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa5880ffe2473092d3c489b072fe75df, type: 3}
  - id: range_ready
    speaker: npc_ossa
    trigger: order.testfire.start
    text: Brann says it's steady. Show me. Three on the plate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8669928b79fc1a0ec00c3cce6c7aac83, type: 3}
  - id: range_tight
    speaker: npc_ossa
    trigger: order.testfire.group:tight
    text: Tight. That pistol's finally pulling its weight.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9c40801cf1086aa80c4620073ae59b7, type: 3}
  - id: range_poor
    speaker: npc_ossa
    trigger: order.testfire.group:poor
    text: Wide. Breathe out, then squeeze. Again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbc99f54f48203ae3e84e5a7f328b63e, type: 3}
  - id: range_done
    speaker: npc_ossa
    trigger: order.testfire.complete
    text: Steady. I'll log the order. Keep that grip clean.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd08fcb2e3ba67c31ca21ad689b83530, type: 3}
